    <p class="kicker">Curriculum Vitae</p>
    <h1>Park Hyokyung</h1>
    <p class="cv-lede">Park Hyokyung is a theatre critic, dramaturg, and researcher in the performing arts, based in Seoul. She is the resident dramaturg at Seongbukdong Beedoolkee Theatre and a contributing writer for <em>SAI Criticism</em>, a web magazine of performing arts criticism. For fourteen years she has also run performances on site, contracted by producers and venues.</p>
    <p class="cv-mail"><a href="mailto:hyokyung.scene@gmail.com">hyokyung.scene@gmail.com</a> <span class="sep">·</span> <a href="/">한국어</a></p>
    <p class="cv-updated">Updated 2026.10.28</p>
  </header>

